 child and an ancestral mystery. Using vintage objects, photographs and ephemera, the narrator takes us on a poignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G2T1QxLtPfcQ7kNvwFM9Nxu&_nc_oc=AdqI1lz7TPnpqKQVa_CnDj5l3QdWn5u0X7Mf4ilBdJjIyI7S_f9JrFGUvkFDwB2540k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCeR9YnuN_W0TQ7lnIGyJ-kBVMVtxXZ31qqy6GkTQ2ubA&oe=6A6CBCC1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cnQHTBm2mAwQ7kNvwEGj7ju&_nc_oc=AdqXyvNhMfgMrja27vetdm5t-GnP9jVibn7rEwGf90GIOTESjIDLYFPH_BNmvcYaDxA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAANoS64X42W-SnIQQYiw3crh_k1iQ9JyCUA0Vg2CM6wQ&oe=6A6C91E6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-TuTpvBGGZwQ7kNvwHORqdB&_nc_oc=AdooI4IXKZFSnpng0JxILbyuPWp0BvKquxYh-Kuhc7ImATI18IbVXcTN7F4eJnZtV8I&_nc_zt=3